{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2023-04-25 14:35:00', 'title': 'NETJETS SUED BY PILOT UNION', 'text': "NJASAP ACCUSES LUXURY JET CARRIER OF SUPPRESSING WORKPLACE SPEECH COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE NETJETS ASSOCIATION OF SHARED AIRCRAFT PILOTS (NJASAP), THE LABOR ORGANIZATION REPRESENTING THE 3,000-PLUS PILOTS EMPLOYED BY BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY'S (NYSE: BRK.A) NETJETS, INC., FILED A COMPLAINT AGAINST THE LUXURY JET CARRIER IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF OHIO. THE LAWSUIT ACCUSES NETJETS OF ATTEMPTING TO SUPPRESS UNION-RELATED PILOT SPEECH IN VIOLATION OF FEDERAL LABOR LAW."}